 "segments": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 3.78,
   "t": "a hidden wire beneath her winter coat, a deadly dinner with her best friend."
  },
  {
   "s": 4.76,
   "e": 9.12,
   "t": "Their investigation led them directly to Amy Loughran, a skilled intensive care nurse"
  },
  {
   "s": 9.12,
   "e": 11.32,
   "t": "and Charles Cullen's closest confidant."
  },
  {
   "s": 12.02,
   "e": 16.68,
   "t": "When we secretly met Amy Loughran outside the facility and laid Cullen's printed"
  },
  {
   "s": 16.68,
   "e": 19.92,
   "t": "pixus access logs before her, she was utterly stunned."
  },
  {
   "s": 20.94,
   "e": 24.16,
   "t": "What made her position perilous was her personal vulnerability,"
  },
  {
   "s": 24.8,
   "e": 29.48,
   "t": "a single mother battling severe cardiomyopathy that endangered her own life."
  },
  {
   "s": 30.26,
   "e": 35.44,
   "t": "Terrified as I was for my own survival and my children's future, I knew staying silent"
  },
  {
   "s": 35.44,
   "e": 38.22,
   "t": "would make me complicit in his murders.\""
  },
  {
   "s": 38.22,
   "e": 42.64,
   "t": "Amy Loughran entered the restaurant, wearing a covert transmitter carefully concealed beneath"
  },
  {
   "s": 42.64,
   "e": 44.54,
   "t": "her winter sweater by state detectives."
  },
  {
   "s": 45.14,
   "e": 49.62,
   "t": "With immense psychological dexterity, Amy gently broached the hospital anomalies"
  },
  {
   "s": 49.62,
   "e": 51.58,
   "t": "and offered to help him find a way out."
  },
  {
   "s": 52.64,
   "e": 57.34,
   "t": "He slumped forward over the table, whispering words captured clearly on tape, I want"
  },
  {
   "s": 57.34,
   "e": 60.36,
   "t": "to stop, I want it all to be over.\""
  },
  {
   "s": 60.36,
   "e": 65.7,
   "t": "He confessed to administering lethal doses of dejoxin and insulin to Father Florian Gaul,"
  },
  {
   "s": 65.9,
   "e": 68.74,
   "t": "Michael Strenko, and dozens of others over the years."
  },
  {
   "s": 69.74,
   "e": 71.7,
   "t": "Episode 4 of Amber Eyes."
  },
  {
   "s": 72.16,
   "e": 74.26,
   "t": "Watch the full documentary via the bio-link."
  }
 ]
}